==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|far|miði|t1=passage, ride|t2=note, ticket|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfar.mɪːðɪ/|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|farmiða|farmiðar}}

#  transportation [[ticket]]; a pass entitling the holder to board a train, a bus, a plane, or other means of transportation.

